# Text is LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included.
#
# GitHub's Windows runners check out with `core.autocrlf=true`, so every text
# file arrived with CRLF while the scripts that generate files write LF, and
# `pnpm docs:check` called every generated page stale. The checks here that
# compare what a script writes with what is committed — the reference pages,
# the compiled plans, the conformance fixture — hold only when a checkout is
# the committed bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Committed with CRLF, and kept exactly as they are.
runtimes/java/gradlew.bat -text
packages/ui-tokens/fonts/OFL.txt -text
